1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,269
Enterprise Skill Platform turns copied agent logic into governed, reusable capabilities.

2
00:00:07,269 --> 00:00:09,578
Employees think in intents.

3
00:00:09,578 --> 00:00:12,663
Enterprise capabilities remain scattered.

4
00:00:12,663 --> 00:00:17,241
ESP bridges the gap through one trusted Copilot.

5
00:00:17,241 --> 00:00:20,081
This public Demo uses synthetic data.

6
00:00:20,081 --> 00:00:24,130
A natural-language request enters the Review workspace.

7
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:32,432
The Router understands intent, validates the Binding, and executes five pinned Skills through authorized Plugins.

8
00:00:32,432 --> 00:00:35,692
Every claim resolves to retained Evidence.

9
00:00:35,692 --> 00:00:41,399
Decision Lineage preserves versions, citations, and the Correlation ID.

10
00:00:41,399 --> 00:00:43,437
The model proposes risk.

11
00:00:43,437 --> 00:00:48,736
The accountable analyst changes the rating and creates Human Decision evidence.

12
00:00:48,736 --> 00:00:53,043
Policy denial stops the responsible Skill and Plugin.

13
00:00:53,043 --> 00:00:57,065
ESP does not bypass policy or invent a result.

14
00:00:57,065 --> 00:01:04,714
The control plane shows versions, Bindings, authorization, human oversight, and the Pilot boundary.

15
00:01:04,714 --> 00:01:09,972
Seven synthetic cases pass all eighty-four mandatory assertions.

16
00:01:09,972 --> 00:01:14,157
Synthetic evidence does not establish Pilot approval.

17
00:01:14,157 --> 00:01:20,557
Two Consumers resolve the same pinned Skill and Plugins with no copied implementation.

18
00:01:20,557 --> 00:01:21,902
Build once.

19
00:01:21,902 --> 00:01:23,097
Govern once.

20
00:01:23,097 --> 00:01:24,836
Reuse everywhere.
